[38;2;124;124;124mThis is essentially asking about Bessel's inequality. In a Hilbert space [0m
[38;2;124;124;124m(complete inner product space), Bessel's inequality gives sum |<x, e_k>|^2 <= ||[0m[38;2;124;124;124mx||^2 with equality iff x is in the closed span. The question is whether strict [0m[38;2;124;124;124minequality can occur.[0m

