[38;2;124;124;124mand x = e_1. Then sum |<e_1, e_k>|^2 = 1 = ||e_1||^2, equality. But take x = (1,[0m[38;2;124;124;124m1/2, 1/4, ...) — no wait that's in the span.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mActually, take any Hilbert space with an orthonormal sequence that is NOT [0m
